1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,555
Holy shit! Is this planning too drunk? Choose 2 out of 3 legendary weapon bundles, or get them for free? You heard it right,

2
00:00:05,555 --> 00:00:08,005
It’s free, and it’s also a legendary weapon bundle.

3
00:00:08,005 --> 00:00:11,436
This event will be launched on August 8th together with the Treasure Month event.

4
00:00:11,436 --> 00:00:15,030
What everyone is most concerned about right now is what guns are included in these three bundles.

5
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:19,931
Pretty much everything has been revealed in this promotional picture. First of all, the windbreaker is holding a big three.

6
00:00:19,931 --> 00:00:23,199
The lower right corner is very conspicuous, and the one in the same series as the Big Three is Victor.

7
00:00:23,199 --> 00:00:28,100
The pistol pressed against Victor looked a bit like the Sand Eagle, since only the Sand Eagle had such a barrel.

8
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:33,164
The one in the lower right corner looks like V.S.S, a giant wave, and three M, so I can’t be sure.

9
00:00:33,164 --> 00:00:38,385
The barrel of the gun with words blocking it under the giant mountain is U.Z.I. The gun on the far left that is blocked by words,

10
00:00:38,385 --> 00:00:42,816
From the barrel, it looks like an A.K Yao Er. Then let's look at the guns in the background.

11
00:00:42,816 --> 00:00:47,879
Looking at the magazine and barrel on the table on the left, you can immediately identify it as a Tamron. Hanging on the wall in the upper left corner,

12
00:00:47,879 --> 00:00:52,310
Just look at the butt and it’s A. Currently, these are the only guns that can be recognized from the promotional pictures.

13
00:00:52,310 --> 00:00:55,000
They seem to be from the same series, so I marked them with the same color.

14
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,787
Is this wave of planning because of drunkenness, or is it because of conscience? We don't know,

15
00:00:58,787 --> 00:01:00,680
Anyway, it’s okay to have something for free.
